      "message": "I built this patch locally to see what it does - in C, this generates `WGPU_NULLABLE WGPUStringView label`, which seems incorrect.\n\n(In C++, I thought this would also accept `bg.SetLabel()` without args, but apparently it doesn\u0027t.)",
