      "writtenOn": "2024-09-24T22:09:01Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "What does optional mean here? I assume optional\u003dtrue means \"convert to `std::optional\u003cstd::string_view\u003e`\" and optional\u003dfalse means \"convert to `std::string_view`\".\n\nLabels should be non-nullable though (defaulting to `\"\"`) so these shouldn\u0027t need to be optional. Maybe this is not true in Dawn yet, in which case this is OK.",
      "revId": "17cada87d0e00341124329cf79c5523f73342b4d",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
    {
